The aulo daemon: serves the aulo.v1 API to the local socket and, when configured, TCP

Usage: aulod [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run      Run in the foreground until SIGINT or SIGTERM (Ctrl+C on Windows)
  service  Run aulod at login: a launchd agent, a systemd user unit or a Task Scheduler task

Options:
      --home <DIR>  The aulo home, ahead of AULO_HOME and ~/.aulo
  -h, --help        Print help
  -V, --version     Print version
